      "desc": "Attending veterinarian and adequate veterinary care (dealers and exhibitors).",
      "narrative": "The facility's written program of veterinary care was incomplete. There was a change in attending veterinarian and the\nnew written program does not address veterinary care for all the covered animals present at the facility. It is also does not\ninclude a formal arrangement for regularly scheduled visits.\nA program of veterinary care is required to ensure facilities are communicating with and following recommendations from\ntheir veterinarian. The licensee must consult with the attending veterinarian and develop a complete and accurate written\nprogram of veterinary care that reflects the practices at this facility. In the case of a part-time attending veterinarian or\nconsultant arrangements, the formal arrangements shall include a written program of veterinary care that includes all\nregulated animals and regularly scheduled visits to the premises.\nCorrect by 7/8/26\nThis inspection and exit interview were conducted with the licensee.\nn"
    }
